        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.name }},</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for reaching out regarding your <strong>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.requirement }}</strong> project.</p>\n\n<p>Based on the requirements you've shared, we'd like to discuss your project with you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Project Details:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Company:</strong> {{ $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.company }}</li>\n<li><strong>Requirement:</strong> {{ $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.requirement }}</li>\n<li><strong>Budget:</strong> {{ $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.budget }}</li>\n<li><strong>Timeline:</strong> {{ $('Code in JavaScript').first().json.timeline }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>We'd be happy to schedule a quick call to understand your requirements, discuss the solution, and plan the next steps.</p>\n\n<p>Please let us know a convenient time to connect.</p>\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>\n<strong>Shwet</strong><br>\nAI & Automation Solutions</p>",
